Z||000000||Capt Fiero||10-03-2001||09:30 PM||||Hello, ok, I have been told that there is someone on Pennock's that had sent in there dues to the West Coast Fiero's of B.C.  Fiero club, and somehow has lost contact with anyone in the club.  Our club has meetings every month at the 50's Dinner in Surrey, located at 100th and King George Hwy.  We have an email server located in Vancouver that you can and should sighn up to, that info can be found from our home page at <A HREF="http://www.westcoastfieros.com" TARGET=_blank>www.westcoastfieros.com</A>  or by going directly to  <A HREF="http://www.pioneernetworks.com/bcfieros-list/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.pioneernetworks.com/bcfieros-list/</A> <P>  Please send me an email at hotrodfiero@shaw.ca and even if you do not wish to be a part of the club, you are still entitled to your Lordco Discount Card.  (local autoparts chain that we have get a discount on all parts including AC Delco stuff)     Please get in touch with me so we can figure out what happend and how you got left behind.  The club is now 60 members.  ||||reg||1
Z||000001||Capt Fiero||10-04-2001||09:46 PM||||Well if ever read this please drop me a line, just so I can stop looking.<P>David||||reg||1
